OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly cloudy with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle, the
OL,7,Frain occasionally heavy in the west.
OL,8,FSome drier and brighter spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping through Counties Antrim and
OL,10,FDown.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FIt will remain cloudy with
OL,13,Ffurther outbreaks of rain,
OL,14,Foccasionally heavy. Some drier spells
OL,15,Fexpected and the winds light or
OL,16,Fmoderate from the southwest. Very mild.
OL,17,
OL,18,CWednesday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,19,Frain, the rain heavy at times. Drier
OL,20,Fand brighter spells developing later
OL,21,Fin the afternoon or evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
