OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Fmixture of bright and sunny spells and
OL,7,Fshowers. Some of the showers will be
OL,8,Fon the heavy side, although mainly dry
OL,9,Fon Saturday.
